    { "key": "day.6.fact", "value": "Action works! As coal-derived outdoor air pollution fell, about 160,000 premature deaths were avoided each year from 2010 to 2022. Every repair and every decision counts." },
    { "key": "game.title", "value": "Second Chance\nWorkshop" },
    { "key": "story.title", "value": "Second Chance Workshop" },
    { "key": "story.text", "value": "You've taken over the neighbourhood's little repair shop. Every morning a truck brings the waste. Everyone calls it trash, but you see something else: a bottle could be a pen holder, a tire could be a lamp base." },
    { "key": "ending.story", "value": "The neighbourhood got a park out of what it called trash." },
